diagrams, traceability and project assessments) is licensed under **CC-BY-4.0**.
See [LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0](LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0).

Original software in `tools/` (except `tools/vendor/`), `.github/workflows/`,
`model/schema/`, `requirements/schema/`, `traceability/schema/`, and the root
`requirements*.txt` dependency declarations is licensed under **MIT**.
See [LICENSE-MIT](LICENSE-MIT). The research content consumed by these tools
retains its research license. These are scoped licenses, not a choice of either
license for every file.

Third-party works, bibliographic facts, attributed source excerpts, names and
identifiers retain their own rights and provenance. This grant covers only the
project's original contributions; it does not relicense cited publications,
historical private inputs, dependencies, third-party schemas or font programs.
Raw thesis/article/full-text inputs and font programs are not distributed.
See [THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).

Attribution: the three creators above, *Clariceptify: An Ontology for Representing
Conceptualization Knowledge*, https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/Clariceptify.
Preserve version/source qualifications and indicate modifications. The owner's
actual decision is recorded in [release-license.md](docs/decisions/release-license.md).
